            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I *think* [this](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/009435c6c3653d54bc62997ca6b2e8513bc52cf4/lua/mini/extra.lua#L1658) line prevents the override.  When I remove that line, the configured line_position is [applied](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/009435c6c3653d54bc62997ca6b2e8513bc52cf4/lua/mini/pick.lua#L2092).\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\n\r\nPerhaps the [fallback](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/009435c6c3653d54bc62997ca6b2e8513bc52cf4/lua/mini/extra.lua#L1656) is not needed in `extra`? When I change `fallback` to be an empty table, the testsuites for `pick` and `extra` still succeed.\r\n\r\n",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I <em>think</em> <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/009435c6c3653d54bc62997ca6b2e8513bc52cf4/lua/mini/extra.lua#L1658\">this</a> line prevents the override.  When I remove that line, the configured line_position is <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/009435c6c3653d54bc62997ca6b2e8513bc52cf4/lua/mini/pick.lua#L2092\">applied</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">EDIT:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Perhaps the <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/009435c6c3653d54bc62997ca6b2e8513bc52cf4/lua/mini/extra.lua#L1656\">fallback</a> is not needed in <code class=\"notranslate\">extra</code>? When I change <code class=\"notranslate\">fallback</code> to be an empty table, the testsuites for <code class=\"notranslate\">pick</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">extra</code> still succeed.</p>",
            "bodyText": "I think this line prevents the override.  When I remove that line, the configured line_position is applied.\nEDIT:\nPerhaps the fallback is not needed in extra? When I change fallback to be an empty table, the testsuites for pick and extra still succeed.",
